1
00:00:02,016 --> 00:00:05,240
Over high mountains and across valleys

2
00:00:05,516 --> 00:00:08,783
With a body like an airplane, the ninja flies freely through the sky

3
00:00:09,056 --> 00:00:12,240
Upright and kind, Hattori-kun is loved by all

4
00:00:12,569 --> 00:00:15,917
Eyes wide open and tiny mouth shut tight

5
00:00:16,117 --> 00:00:19,520
Hiding his face with cheeks puffed up

6
00:00:19,650 --> 00:00:23,040
Catching villains with agility, moving quick as lightning

7
00:00:23,183 --> 00:00:26,320
Catching bad guys with quirky tricks, just like magic

8
00:00:26,937 --> 00:00:30,040
Speaking like poetry, polite yet full of spirit

9
00:00:32,826 --> 00:00:35,600
[Hattori-kun Never Misses]

10
00:00:38,583 --> 00:00:40,286
Kenichi

11
00:00:40,981 --> 00:00:41,991
Yumeko

12
00:00:42,041 --> 00:00:43,108
Tomorrow, are you guys

13
00:00:43,159 --> 00:00:45,149
playing baseball against the Little Devils?

14
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:45,811
Yeah

15
00:00:45,862 --> 00:00:47,700
In that case, I'll definitely come cheer for you

16
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:48,960
Give it your all!

17
00:00:49,290 --> 00:00:51,800
I'll be at the field no matter what, see you

18
00:00:52,389 --> 00:00:53,503
Oh no, this is bad

19
00:00:53,554 --> 00:00:55,725
If I played well, I'd love for them to come watch

20
00:00:55,776 --> 00:00:57,920
The problem is I'm terrible

21
00:00:58,930 --> 00:01:00,916
Alright, time to practice like crazy!

22
00:01:06,888 --> 00:01:09,996
Oh man, I really am terrible at this

23
00:01:13,158 --> 00:01:14,122
Huh, that's weird

24
00:01:14,173 --> 00:01:16,680
- I clearly saw someone just now
- Kenichi

25
00:01:17,452 --> 00:01:18,888
Is that Ninja Hattori-kun?

26
00:01:18,925 --> 00:01:22,678
Baseball skills are pretty similar
to my ninja techniques

27
00:01:23,393 --> 00:01:24,601
Are they really?

28
00:01:24,659 --> 00:01:25,940
Alright, I'll be the pitcher

29
00:01:25,991 --> 00:01:27,721
Try hitting the ball for me

30
00:01:27,772 --> 00:01:30,071
Yan... Yan!

31
00:01:32,061 --> 00:01:33,698
What's with that weird stance?

32
00:01:33,749 --> 00:01:34,880
Here comes the pitch!

33
00:01:36,680 --> 00:01:37,781
Yan!

34
00:01:38,040 --> 00:01:41,398
Woah, impressive!

35
00:01:42,223 --> 00:01:44,223
Alright, let's practice catching now, put on your glove

36
00:01:44,274 --> 00:01:45,934
I don't need a glove

37
00:01:45,985 --> 00:01:46,922
Okay

38
00:01:48,688 --> 00:01:50,796
Alright, I'm throwing it now

39
00:01:50,935 --> 00:01:53,259
Oh, a ground ball!

40
00:01:53,310 --> 00:01:54,800
Yan...

41
00:01:55,565 --> 00:01:56,752
A bounce ball!

42
00:01:56,803 --> 00:01:58,920
Yan...

43
00:02:02,530 --> 00:02:03,280
Yan!

44
00:02:04,403 --> 00:02:05,823
Wow, you're amazing, Hattori-kun!

45
00:02:05,874 --> 00:02:08,188
Please be my coach, promise me

46
00:02:08,233 --> 00:02:09,704
Come on, Master Hattori-kun

47
00:02:09,748 --> 00:02:11,301
I'll even get down on my knees and beg!

48
00:02:11,359 --> 00:02:12,687
Please, before tomorrow

49
00:02:12,738 --> 00:02:14,545
turn me into a great baseball player!

50
00:02:14,576 --> 00:02:17,215
Huh? You want to become a great player in just one day?

51
00:02:18,716 --> 00:02:21,332
Kenichi, take a look at what these are

52
00:02:21,450 --> 00:02:22,479
Red beans?

53
00:02:22,530 --> 00:02:23,666
That's right

54
00:02:23,717 --> 00:02:25,668
- Are you making sweet red bean soup?
- No

55
00:02:25,711 --> 00:02:27,579
What I mean is, when I practice swordsmanship

56
00:02:27,630 --> 00:02:30,216
I have to focus and stare at a red bean

57
00:02:30,515 --> 00:02:31,604
It's really strange

58
00:02:31,655 --> 00:02:33,802
When you stare at the bean for a long time

59
00:02:33,853 --> 00:02:36,390
it naturally starts looking bigger

60
00:02:36,441 --> 00:02:38,040
And then...

61
00:02:38,735 --> 00:02:40,579
Whether it's a red bean or a grain of rice

62
00:02:40,630 --> 00:02:42,680
you can slice it in half right away

63
00:02:43,156 --> 00:02:44,680
A baseball is so big

64
00:02:44,731 --> 00:02:47,061
it should be really easy to hit, right?

65
00:02:47,375 --> 00:02:49,017
That makes a lot of sense

66
00:02:49,710 --> 00:02:50,850
All right

67
00:02:51,014 --> 00:02:52,171
Well, if that's the case

68
00:02:52,228 --> 00:02:55,601
no matter what, I'm staying up tonight
and staring at this red bean all night

69
00:03:04,685 --> 00:03:07,591
Why isn't this red bean getting any bigger no matter how much I stare?

70
00:03:07,642 --> 00:03:10,505
It's simple, because your training isn't there yet

71
00:03:14,046 --> 00:03:15,621
Oh no, shoot...

72
00:03:15,672 --> 00:03:18,195
I must have fallen asleep without realising it last night

73
00:03:18,246 --> 00:03:19,948
Where's the... where's the red bean?

74
00:03:19,999 --> 00:03:23,419
- Wow, it looks huge
- How about this baseball then?

75
00:03:28,236 --> 00:03:29,971
It looks huge too

76
00:03:30,022 --> 00:03:32,342
If it looks bigger, that means you've...

77
00:03:32,373 --> 00:03:34,570
I finally did it!

78
00:03:34,621 --> 00:03:35,720
This is so great!

79
00:03:35,884 --> 00:03:37,657
Thank you so much, Hattori-kun!

80
00:03:37,708 --> 00:03:40,415
I'm definitely going to... steal the show today

81
00:03:40,606 --> 00:03:43,095
Kenichi, why aren't you up yet?

82
00:03:43,173 --> 00:03:45,553
Oh no, it's eight o'clock already? Huh?

83
00:03:47,509 --> 00:03:49,349
Wait, why is this red bean so huge?

84
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:50,713
Where did you get it?

85
00:03:51,066 --> 00:03:53,557
Wait, Mom sees it as huge too?

86
00:03:53,716 --> 00:03:56,552
Oh no, it's a fake red bean!

87
00:03:56,603 --> 00:03:57,893
I get it, Hattori-kun

88
00:03:57,943 --> 00:03:59,666
You wanted to build up my confidence, didn't you?

89
00:04:00,095 --> 00:04:01,900
Yan...

90
00:04:03,304 --> 00:04:04,640
Kenichi!

91
00:04:05,145 --> 00:04:07,492
Oh no, Mom, please tell them I caught a cold

92
00:04:07,543 --> 00:04:09,640
and can't play in the game!

93
00:04:10,350 --> 00:04:12,810
Everyone, I am so very sorry

94
00:04:13,062 --> 00:04:14,179
Yan...

95
00:04:20,006 --> 00:04:20,993
Hey, it's Kenichi

96
00:04:21,044 --> 00:04:23,175
You still came to play even with a cold?

97
00:04:28,643 --> 00:04:30,053
He missed all three swings

98
00:04:30,104 --> 00:04:32,510
That's eight strike outs in a row now!

99
00:04:32,550 --> 00:04:34,805
Oh no, Kenichi is up next!

100
00:04:34,856 --> 00:04:36,883
Go get 'em, Kenichi!

101
00:04:39,216 --> 00:04:40,701
It's Kenichi's turn to bat

102
00:04:40,752 --> 00:04:42,422
We don't stand a chance

103
00:04:42,983 --> 00:04:44,583
His stance is so weird

104
00:04:46,774 --> 00:04:48,510
Kenichi definitely knows he's going to strike out

105
00:04:48,593 --> 00:04:50,707
so he's just swinging wildly

106
00:04:55,520 --> 00:04:57,417
Awesome, it's a home run!

107
00:04:57,475 --> 00:04:59,450
Wow, incredible!

108
00:05:03,702 --> 00:05:06,297
Wait... how... how did that happen?

109
00:05:07,956 --> 00:05:10,709
- Wow, amazing!
- Keep it up, Kenichi! Keep it up!

110
00:05:10,760 --> 00:05:12,412
Yan...

111
00:05:13,172 --> 00:05:14,968
Nice one, Kenichi!

112
00:05:17,232 --> 00:05:19,960
Wait, what's going on?

113
00:05:20,658 --> 00:05:22,728
Wait... isn't this my jersey?

114
00:05:22,779 --> 00:05:23,952
Who on earth was that?

115
00:05:24,003 --> 00:05:26,775
- Kenichi...
- Kenichi...

116
00:05:26,826 --> 00:05:28,240
I'd better put it on first

117
00:05:29,045 --> 00:05:31,028
Kenichi, where did you go?

118
00:05:31,079 --> 00:05:32,392
It's your turn to bat now

119
00:05:32,443 --> 00:05:34,019
Just one more run and we win for sure

120
00:05:34,070 --> 00:05:35,424
Kenichi, you've got to give it everything!

121
00:05:35,475 --> 00:05:37,349
Oh no, why does it have to be at crunch time

122
00:05:37,400 --> 00:05:39,371
-...that it's my turn?
-One, two, three! Three, two, one!

123
00:05:39,422 --> 00:05:41,400
Kenichi can definitely do it!

124
00:05:42,101 --> 00:05:43,720
Oh well, I'm gonna embarrass myself anyway

125
00:05:43,771 --> 00:05:45,304
Might as well just swing wildly!

126
00:05:47,135 --> 00:05:51,205
Why is Kenichi up again?
He's definitely my jinx today!

127
00:05:55,126 --> 00:05:56,516
-Oh no, that ball was too fast!
-Strike!

128
00:05:56,556 --> 00:05:57,508
I couldn't hit it!

129
00:05:57,562 --> 00:06:00,261
Man, he doesn't take me seriously at all

130
00:06:00,312 --> 00:06:01,605
Outrageous!

131
00:06:05,964 --> 00:06:06,819
Hooray!

132
00:06:06,870 --> 00:06:09,013
Hooray! Our team won!

133
00:06:09,243 --> 00:06:12,306
Awesome! We only won today thanks to you!

134
00:06:12,357 --> 00:06:15,590
Kenichi, you're really amazing, Kenichi!

135
00:06:15,796 --> 00:06:17,491
No, I was just...

136
00:06:17,541 --> 00:06:20,283
No need to be so modest, you must have been holding back!

137
00:06:20,340 --> 00:06:22,513
-You're awesome!
-You're really great!

138
00:06:23,250 --> 00:06:25,392
A little trick did the job

139
00:06:28,270 --> 00:06:31,310
[The Transfer Student from Koga]

140
00:06:36,703 --> 00:06:37,453
Everyone

141
00:06:37,504 --> 00:06:40,717
This is Kemumaki, who just transferred
to our school

142
00:06:41,297 --> 00:06:43,400
Pleased to meet you all

143
00:06:43,796 --> 00:06:46,750
He looks like a pretty honest guy

144
00:06:52,063 --> 00:06:55,210
Hey, do you want to play baseball with us?

145
00:06:55,261 --> 00:06:56,760
Oh, I don't know how to play

146
00:06:57,594 --> 00:06:59,396
Look at him, such a sissy

147
00:06:59,453 --> 00:07:00,560
Watch out!

148
00:07:02,607 --> 00:07:04,057
Heh, I've got it

149
00:07:05,583 --> 00:07:07,210
You're so skilled at catching?

150
00:07:07,261 --> 00:07:08,656
I just got lucky

151
00:07:08,707 --> 00:07:09,581
Really?

152
00:07:10,485 --> 00:07:12,178
By the way, Kemumaki

153
00:07:12,228 --> 00:07:13,509
You know how to embroider?

154
00:07:13,560 --> 00:07:15,069
Y-Yes, Yumeko

155
00:07:15,120 --> 00:07:16,745
Wow, it's so pretty!

156
00:07:16,795 --> 00:07:18,640
If you like it, I can give it to you

157
00:07:18,873 --> 00:07:20,523
Really? For me?

158
00:07:20,573 --> 00:07:21,415
Thank you!

159
00:07:26,276 --> 00:07:29,079
Kenichi, Kemumaki's craftwork is really nice

160
00:07:29,104 --> 00:07:30,396
I suppose so

161
00:07:30,447 --> 00:07:32,465
Oh dear, what should I do?

162
00:07:32,516 --> 00:07:35,950
I'm wearing new shoes today, so I don't want to get them wet

163
00:07:38,303 --> 00:07:41,160
Here, step on my schoolbag so they won't get wet

164
00:07:41,457 --> 00:07:43,265
Man, this guy isn't just pretentious...

165
00:07:43,316 --> 00:07:44,920
-...he's totally fake too!
-You're so kind!

166
00:07:45,272 --> 00:07:46,400
I couldn't possibly!

167
00:07:47,697 --> 00:07:49,003
Thank you so much!

168
00:07:49,054 --> 00:07:50,541
You're really so sweet!

169
00:07:50,592 --> 00:07:52,920
Don't mention it, it's the least I could do

170
00:07:58,664 --> 00:08:00,566
Well then, goodbye, Kemumaki!

171
00:08:00,623 --> 00:08:01,519
See you tomorrow morning!

172
00:08:01,570 --> 00:08:02,586
Oh man, why didn't Yumeko...

173
00:08:02,637 --> 00:08:04,710
S-She didn't say "goodbye" to me?

174
00:08:07,841 --> 00:08:09,768
Why did you suddenly turn into a completely different person?

175
00:08:09,819 --> 00:08:12,061
It's not surprising at all since I have a split personality

176
00:08:12,112 --> 00:08:13,568
Your tone got all nasty too!

177
00:08:13,618 --> 00:08:15,072
Come on, give me a massage

178
00:08:15,625 --> 00:08:16,548
You must be joking

179
00:08:16,592 --> 00:08:19,019
Why on earth should I give you a massage out of nowhere?

180
00:08:19,070 --> 00:08:20,470
Fine, if you won't give me a massage

181
00:08:20,520 --> 00:08:21,506
I'll give you one!

182
00:08:21,812 --> 00:08:23,440
Stop squeezing me!

183
00:08:24,975 --> 00:08:26,555
Be gentler!

184
00:08:29,679 --> 00:08:30,760
Teacher is here!

185
00:08:31,205 --> 00:08:32,633
Quick, switch places!

186
00:08:35,172 --> 00:08:37,202
What are you two doing?

187
00:08:37,253 --> 00:08:38,116
Uh... well...

188
00:08:38,173 --> 00:08:40,696
Kenichi has been taking great care of me in every way

189
00:08:40,747 --> 00:08:42,922
so I'm giving him a massage

190
00:08:42,973 --> 00:08:43,972
Hey, Kenichi!

191
00:08:44,029 --> 00:08:46,063
How could you make a classmate do that?

192
00:08:46,239 --> 00:08:47,749
Sir, I didn't!

193
00:08:47,809 --> 00:08:49,269
Not another word!

194
00:08:51,039 --> 00:08:52,306
Don't you know your responsibility

195
00:08:52,357 --> 00:08:54,323
is to guide transfer students?

196
00:08:57,265 --> 00:08:58,628
That was so much fun just now

197
00:08:58,691 --> 00:09:01,370
I didn't think it was fun at all, I'm leaving!

198
00:09:01,815 --> 00:09:02,748
Hey, wait up!

199
00:09:02,799 --> 00:09:04,400
I'll grace your home with a visit

200
00:09:06,325 --> 00:09:07,834
I'm home!

201
00:09:07,885 --> 00:09:09,200
You're back, sweetie?

202
00:09:09,691 --> 00:09:11,945
Mom, this is my classmate Kemumaki

203
00:09:12,105 --> 00:09:13,870
Sorry for the intrusion!

204
00:09:14,899 --> 00:09:16,103
I'm really so envious

205
00:09:16,159 --> 00:09:18,219
Kenichi, you have such a gentle and pretty older sister

206
00:09:18,270 --> 00:09:20,185
She's not my sister, she's my mom!

207
00:09:20,236 --> 00:09:21,943
Oh my, really?

208
00:09:22,176 --> 00:09:24,823
Do I really look that young?

209
00:09:25,643 --> 00:09:27,329
Here, this is my room

210
00:09:28,284 --> 00:09:29,928
Hey, what are you doing?

211
00:09:35,721 --> 00:09:36,440
You go in first!

212
00:09:38,188 --> 00:09:39,096
Where is it?

213
00:09:40,013 --> 00:09:41,560
Right, it's here

214
00:09:41,950 --> 00:09:44,989
Iga ninja, take this! Come on out!

215
00:09:48,840 --> 00:09:49,725
Ah, Yan!

216
00:09:51,623 --> 00:09:53,013
Oh no, don't...

217
00:09:53,186 --> 00:09:54,040
Don't do that!

218
00:09:54,868 --> 00:09:55,632
Take that!

219
00:09:56,728 --> 00:09:58,590
Oh no, darn it, he got away!

220
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:03,800
Over here!

221
00:10:09,708 --> 00:10:12,178
Kenichi, what on earth are you two doing in your room?

222
00:10:12,229 --> 00:10:13,490
Oh dear, stop fighting!

223
00:10:13,540 --> 00:10:15,399
Stop, Mom is here!

224
00:10:17,094 --> 00:10:18,724
Take this Smoke Screen Technique!

225
00:10:18,781 --> 00:10:21,419
Oh my, why is there so much smoke in the room?
What on earth is going on?

226
00:10:22,305 --> 00:10:25,479
-Kemumaki, what happened?
-A weird kid was bullying me!

227
00:10:25,530 --> 00:10:26,955
Oh, Hattori-kun?

228
00:10:27,006 --> 00:10:28,315
Yan...

229
00:10:30,557 --> 00:10:31,499
Unbelievable!

230
00:10:31,550 --> 00:10:34,132
How could you bully such an honest kid?

231
00:10:34,183 --> 00:10:35,783
Mom, I wasn't bullying him!

232
00:10:35,834 --> 00:10:38,227
As punishment, neither of you gets any snacks!

233
00:10:38,787 --> 00:10:41,120
Ma'am, please forgive them

234
00:10:41,571 --> 00:10:42,564
Because in this place

235
00:10:42,615 --> 00:10:43,884
they're my very first friends

236
00:10:43,934 --> 00:10:45,125
I really care about them

237
00:10:45,175 --> 00:10:46,483
There he goes being a hypocrite again

238
00:10:46,534 --> 00:10:47,856
Back at my old school

239
00:10:47,913 --> 00:10:49,910
because I was too honest and far too kind

240
00:10:49,961 --> 00:10:51,638
So no one was willing to be my friend

241
00:10:51,689 --> 00:10:54,222
Which made me feel very lonely

242
00:10:54,272 --> 00:10:55,989
Oh, how pitiful

243
00:10:56,039 --> 00:10:56,704
Kenichi

244
00:10:56,755 --> 00:10:58,744
I want you to become good friends with Kemumaki

245
00:10:58,795 --> 00:11:00,108
Keep that in mind, okay?

246
00:11:03,628 --> 00:11:06,809
Who on earth is that Kemumaki anyway?

247
00:11:06,860 --> 00:11:09,523
He's a ninja from the Koga clan

248
00:11:09,573 --> 00:11:12,014
We of the Iga clan and Koga ninjas...

249
00:11:12,064 --> 00:11:13,112
Are mortal enemies!

250
00:11:13,163 --> 00:11:13,870
No wonder

251
00:11:13,933 --> 00:11:15,493
When he saw you earlier

252
00:11:15,544 --> 00:11:17,126
He looked like he was fuming with rage

253
00:11:20,651 --> 00:11:23,071
Hey, I haven't settled yesterday's score with you yet

254
00:11:23,123 --> 00:11:25,512
I challenge the Iga ninja at your house to a duel!

255
00:11:25,563 --> 00:11:27,938
Dueling is barbaric, why do that?

256
00:11:27,989 --> 00:11:29,224
- Why not just be friends?
- Bah, nonsense!

257
00:11:29,275 --> 00:11:31,360
Do you want me to beat you up again?

258
00:11:35,432 --> 00:11:37,521
So the Iga ninja was hiding here, was he?

259
00:11:37,586 --> 00:11:39,802
That's right, to protect me

260
00:11:39,853 --> 00:11:41,219
Hattori-kun always walks to school with me

261
00:11:41,270 --> 00:11:43,600
Great, then let's duel right here!

262
00:11:44,219 --> 00:11:46,460
This is a school, how can we duel here?

263
00:11:46,511 --> 00:11:47,546
Take this!

264
00:11:48,317 --> 00:11:50,130
Don't! Please don't do this!

265
00:11:50,181 --> 00:11:51,800
Stop fighting! Hey, don't!

266
00:11:51,851 --> 00:11:53,640
What's all the racket?

267
00:11:57,463 --> 00:11:58,313
Kenichi

268
00:11:58,376 --> 00:11:59,745
Did you ask Kemumaki

269
00:11:59,795 --> 00:12:01,408
To give you a massage again today?

270
00:12:01,856 --> 00:12:03,003
Nothing like that happened!

271
00:12:03,054 --> 00:12:04,880
Kemumaki, come over here

272
00:12:07,496 --> 00:12:09,195
Oh, he's gone?

273
00:12:09,245 --> 00:12:11,044
Where did Kemumaki go?

274
00:12:11,825 --> 00:12:12,946
Hey, Kenichi

275
00:12:13,002 --> 00:12:14,132
Outrageous!

276
00:12:14,183 --> 00:12:15,336
Pranking your teacher like that

277
00:12:15,388 --> 00:12:16,452
I didn't! When did I?

278
00:12:16,503 --> 00:12:18,331
It really had nothing to do with me

279
00:12:18,476 --> 00:12:20,666
In the end, the teacher yelled at me again

280
00:12:20,717 --> 00:12:22,872
We'll settle this another day!

281
00:12:25,705 --> 00:12:28,707
[Shinzo arrives to pay his respects]

282
00:12:49,264 --> 00:12:50,626
Hey... wait a second, kid!

283
00:12:50,677 --> 00:12:52,584
Hey, your ticket! Pay the fare!

284
00:12:52,771 --> 00:12:53,690
Here

285
00:12:53,741 --> 00:12:54,534
Whoa!

286
00:12:56,757 --> 00:12:58,641
Hey, hold on...

287
00:12:58,691 --> 00:13:01,204
Hey, the fare! You haven't paid the fare!

288
00:13:12,350 --> 00:13:14,403
This is called the Smoke Screen Technique!

289
00:13:18,232 --> 00:13:19,772
Alright, what on earth is going on?

290
00:13:19,823 --> 00:13:21,300
Look up there

291
00:13:22,272 --> 00:13:23,649
Hey, kid, you're in danger!

292
00:13:23,700 --> 00:13:24,589
Stay right there and don't move

293
00:13:24,640 --> 00:13:25,561
I'm coming to save you now!

294
00:13:32,071 --> 00:13:33,560
See ya!

295
00:13:33,611 --> 00:13:35,919
Hey, don't! Don't jump down!

296
00:13:35,970 --> 00:13:37,520
- Oh no, don't jump down!
- Oh dear, it's dangerous!

297
00:13:41,247 --> 00:13:42,663
Oh no, this is awful

298
00:13:42,714 --> 00:13:44,884
I'm afraid of heights!

299
00:13:52,264 --> 00:13:53,824
Kenichi and Hattori-kun

300
00:13:53,875 --> 00:13:54,944
Where on earth did they go?

301
00:13:55,310 --> 00:13:56,890
They went outside to play

302
00:13:56,941 --> 00:13:59,224
Oh, no wonder the house is so quiet

303
00:14:04,693 --> 00:14:07,386
Man, I'm exhausted. Let me sit down

304
00:14:11,906 --> 00:14:12,973
Delicious!

305
00:14:13,346 --> 00:14:15,660
Hey, kid, who are you?

306
00:14:16,966 --> 00:14:18,817
Aw, where is it?

307
00:14:19,490 --> 00:14:21,096
Huh? What on earth are you looking for?

308
00:14:21,397 --> 00:14:22,677
It must be up there

309
00:14:23,196 --> 00:14:24,250
Up there?

310
00:14:27,017 --> 00:14:29,550
Not here? Aw man

311
00:14:32,510 --> 00:14:34,348
Nope, not here either

312
00:14:37,748 --> 00:14:41,468
Not there either, nowhere... Where did it go?

313
00:14:41,521 --> 00:14:42,575
Where is it? This is infuriating!

314
00:14:52,227 --> 00:14:54,038
The way he cries is really terrifying

315
00:14:54,063 --> 00:14:56,002
He's given me such a headache

316
00:14:56,037 --> 00:14:58,030
Please don't cry

317
00:15:06,000 --> 00:15:06,970
Where is it?

318
00:15:09,796 --> 00:15:10,909
Ah, over there!

319
00:15:11,703 --> 00:15:13,900
Who on earth is that kid anyway?

320
00:15:13,963 --> 00:15:16,900
I'd say this kid definitely has some connection

321
00:15:27,133 --> 00:15:28,866
Ugh, Kemumaki again?

322
00:15:29,725 --> 00:15:32,152
Hattori-kun, today we settle this once and for all!

323
00:15:32,204 --> 00:15:33,900
Kemumaki, don't fight!

324
00:15:33,951 --> 00:15:35,293
Shut up! Hattori-kun

325
00:15:35,344 --> 00:15:36,986
If you don't want Kenichi to get hurt

326
00:15:37,037 --> 00:15:38,560
Then hurry up and fight me!

327
00:15:40,850 --> 00:15:42,450
Who's there? Come out!

328
00:15:44,802 --> 00:15:46,042
Shinzo?

329
00:15:46,355 --> 00:15:47,609
Shinzo...

330
00:15:47,660 --> 00:15:48,814
Hey, Shishimaru!

331
00:15:48,865 --> 00:15:50,982
Big brother, let me give you a hand!

332
00:15:51,398 --> 00:15:53,217
Hattori-kun's little brother is here?

333
00:15:53,268 --> 00:15:55,678
That's right, I'm Hattori-kun's little brother!

334
00:15:55,729 --> 00:15:58,015
He's Hattori-kun's little brother?

335
00:15:59,700 --> 00:16:01,032
Now let me help my brother

336
00:16:01,083 --> 00:16:02,520
I'm going to take you down!

337
00:16:03,833 --> 00:16:05,377
Just cheap tricks!

338
00:16:05,427 --> 00:16:08,136
What, these are just bamboo shuriken?

339
00:16:08,187 --> 00:16:09,504
I'm not a full-fledged ninja yet

340
00:16:09,554 --> 00:16:11,569
So I'm not allowed to carry lethal shuriken

341
00:16:11,620 --> 00:16:15,040
All right, now taste the power of a real ninja!

342
00:16:20,563 --> 00:16:22,960
How are you? Are you all right?

343
00:16:23,682 --> 00:16:24,760
Let me take care of him

344
00:16:24,937 --> 00:16:27,402
Big brother, I can defeat him all by myself!

345
00:16:27,453 --> 00:16:29,532
Huh, didn't expect this kid to talk so big

346
00:16:29,583 --> 00:16:31,582
We haven't settled who's better yet

347
00:16:33,455 --> 00:16:36,064
Almost there... Cry already...

348
00:16:36,115 --> 00:16:38,640
How about that? Now you know the power of the Koga clan!

349
00:16:38,730 --> 00:16:39,880
Damn it!

350
00:16:40,650 --> 00:16:42,480
Do you know how tough I am now?

351
00:16:51,189 --> 00:16:54,010
Ouch... The vibration almost split my head open!

352
00:16:54,061 --> 00:16:55,130
Well, how about that?

353
00:16:55,181 --> 00:16:57,651
Pretty impressive weapon, huh? Ready to give up?

354
00:16:57,702 --> 00:16:59,983
I give up, I give up!

355
00:17:01,403 --> 00:17:03,221
Your secret weapon really is amazing!

356
00:17:03,272 --> 00:17:04,770
Compared to big brother's skills

357
00:17:04,828 --> 00:17:06,970
It completely pales in comparison

358
00:17:07,123 --> 00:17:08,946
Kenichi, let me introduce you

359
00:17:08,997 --> 00:17:11,080
This is my little brother, his name is...

360
00:17:12,890 --> 00:17:15,790
Of course, he passed out from all your crying

361
00:17:20,511 --> 00:17:23,174
Oh, so he's Hattori-kun's little brother?

362
00:17:23,237 --> 00:17:25,406
I knew they were related all along

363
00:17:25,457 --> 00:17:27,795
Let's let him stay here, okay?

364
00:17:27,846 --> 00:17:29,920
Our family has grown to five now

365
00:17:30,284 --> 00:17:32,454
Ah, things are certainly going to get lively

366
00:17:34,587 --> 00:17:37,041
Mommy, where did you go?

367
00:17:37,099 --> 00:17:39,080
Why did you just leave me?

368
00:17:42,068 --> 00:17:44,720
Oh no, he's about to cry!

369
00:17:45,580 --> 00:17:47,582
Whatever you do, don't let him cry!

370
00:17:47,633 --> 00:17:49,116
Change the channel, quick!

371
00:17:49,167 --> 00:17:50,960
Oh no, change it again!

372
00:17:51,081 --> 00:17:52,286
On it!

373
00:17:52,337 --> 00:17:54,237
Oh, Mommy, please don't die!

374
00:17:54,288 --> 00:17:56,560
Don't leave us behind!

375
00:17:57,686 --> 00:17:59,087
Who says I'm silly?

376
00:17:59,138 --> 00:18:00,653
I say you're dumber than a roast goose!

377
00:18:00,704 --> 00:18:01,793
You think you're so smart?

378
00:18:01,844 --> 00:18:03,185
Who's cooler than me?

379
00:18:03,210 --> 00:18:04,050
How are you cool? Spit it out!

380
00:18:04,210 --> 00:18:05,428
I'm the coolest, you're the fool!

381
00:18:05,452 --> 00:18:07,056
You didn't watch? It's awesome!

382
00:18:07,081 --> 00:18:08,463
You think you're so great?

383
00:18:12,877 --> 00:18:15,737
Now that Shinzo is here, things are going to be troublesome

